 "description": "A well-positioned one-bedroom apartment located within High Point, just off Noel Street in Hyson Green, offering practical accommodation with excellent access to Nottingham City Centre, local amenities and tram links.\r\n\r\nThis apartment presents a strong opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or anyone seeking a conveniently located city-fringe home. The property is set within the established High Point development and benefits from a highly accessible position close to local shops, supermarkets, transport links and key Nottingham employment and education hubs.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is arranged to provide a living area, fitted kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom, making it a practical and manageable home in a well-connected location. The layout is particularly suited to buyers looking for a low-maintenance apartment or landlords seeking a rental investment in an area with consistent tenant demand.\r\n\r\nHigh Point is positioned close to The Forest Recreation Ground and tram connections, with Nottingham City Centre, Nottingham Trent University and Queens Medical Centre all within easy reach. The area is well served by everyday amenities, including shops, restaurants, takeaways and public transport options. Nearby tram access is a clear selling point for both owner-occupiers and tenants.",
